think Trump's fixation with election fraud&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.360
could cost them in elections. I think the&nbsp;
same thing, and I'm hoping that it happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:31.440
and I think that there's there's there's a few&nbsp;
different things to talk about here. First of all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:37.360
it's sort of like six years too late in&nbsp;
the sense that we would be living not in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:43.520
different country, but on a different planet had&nbsp;
Republicans had these meetings previously. Now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:49.760
they kind of did have these meetings early on in&nbsp;
the Republican primary and ultimately their voters&nbsp;&nbsp;

