and talking points and this sort of thing. And&nbsp;
what that led to in 2016 was a monster that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:24.240
couldn't even control. Could they have turned the&nbsp;
ship around once it was summer of 2016? I don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:30.080
know. I don't know if they could have the the&nbsp;
other, you know, at the same time. The best time&nbsp;&nbsp;

